      "explanation": "The doctor gave a low-burden caregiver plan for recording food/glucose, bringing documents and drug boxes, and arranging follow-up through accessible clinics. This had real trajectory impact by producing caregiver teach-back and ongoing home monitoring, although it does not mitigate the serious insulin safety error.",
